OL,5,G1600 Are Teenagers Ready for Work?
OL,6,     FTeenagers Jasmine and Javaris ask
OL,7,     Fif they're prepared for leaving
OL,8,     Fschool. They question work
OL,9,     Fexperience bosses, school staff
OL,10,     Fand working young people if teens
OL,11,     Fare ready for work.
