OL,5,G2145 Cafe Hope
OL,6,     FFounder of How To Be Adopted,
OL,7,     FClaire Moruzzi, tells Rachel
OL,8,     FBurden how her adoptee experience
OL,9,     Fhas helped her support other adult
OL,10,     Fadoptees dealing with the impact
OL,11,     Fof being adopted.
OL,12,G2200 The World Tonight
OL,13,G2245 Partita by Barbara Kingsolver
OL,14,     F6/10. As Livia clears her mother's
OL,15,     Fhouse, she uncovers answers about
OL,16,     Fher brother's tragic death.
OL,17,     FBarbara Kingsolver's ode to music,
OL,18,     Flove and community continues. Read
OL,19,     Fby Laurel Lefkow.
